    "solution": "<p><span style=\"\">According to the English alphabets and their positional values:</span><br style=\"\" />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/11/Alphabet%20Dia.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 500px; height: 106px;\" /><span style=\"\">​</span><br style=\"\" />\n<span style=\"\">The pattern followed in the given series is:<br />\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>The alphabets with 2 digit positional values are coded as sum of the digits and the alphabets with 1 digit positional value are coded as it is.</strong></span><br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Savita_SSC_29-9-22_D46.png\" style=\"width: 258px; height: 124px;\" /><br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Savita_SSC_29-9-22_D47.png\" style=\"width: 187px; height: 123px;\" /><br />\nSimilarly,<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Savita_SSC_29-9-22_D48.png\" style=\"width: 258px; height: 132px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence&nbsp;<strong>the correct answer is option 2)</strong></span></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला और उनके स्थितीय मानों&nbsp;के अनुसार:<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/11/Alphabet%20Dia.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 500px; height: 106px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>दी गई श्रेणी में अनुसरण किया गया पैटर्न है:<br />\n2 अंकों के स्थितीय मानों वाले अक्षरों को अंकों के योग के रूप में लिखा&nbsp;जाता है और 1 अंकों के स्थितीय मान वाले अक्षरों को लिखा&nbsp;जाता है।</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Savita_SSC_29-9-22_D46.png\" style=\" width: 258px; height: 124px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Savita_SSC_29-9-22_D47.png\" style=\" width: 187px; height: 123px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>पूर्णतः</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Savita_SSC_29-9-22_D48.png\" style=\" width: 258px; height: 132px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>अत: सही उत्तर विकल्प 2 है।&nbsp;</strong></p>\n",
