    "question": "<div>If SHADOW is coded as 184 and TEDIOUS is coded as 384, then how will VALIDATE be coded as?</div>\n",
    "question_hi": "यदि SHADOW को 184 और TEDIOUS को 384 के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाता है, तो VALIDATE को किस प्रकार कूटबद्ध किया जाएगा?",
    "options": [
      "<span style=\"\">486</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">468</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">568</span>",
      "<span style=\"\">586</span>",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "486",
      "468",
      "568",
      "586",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p><strong>The table is alphabets place value:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/alphabet.png\" style=\" font-weight: 700; width: 450px; height: 107px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Sum of the opposite alphabets places value &times; number of vowels = number.</strong></p>\n\n<p>SHADOW is coded as 184</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>SHADOW&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;</strong>Total number of vowels (A, O) is 2.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Madhuri_SSC_14.05.2022_D27.png\" style=\"width: 313px; height: 207px;\" /></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Sum of the opposite alphabets place value &times; number of vowels = number.</li>\n\t<li>=&gt; (8 + 19 + 26 + 23 + 12 + 4) &times; 2 = 92 &times; 2 = 184</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>And,</p>\n\n<p>TEDIOUS is coded as 384</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>TEDIOUS</strong><strong> &rarr;&nbsp;</strong>Total number of vowels (E, I, O, U) is 4.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Madhuri_SSC_14.05.2022_D28.png\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 207px;\" /></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Sum of the opposite alphabets place value &times; number of vowels = number.</li>\n\t<li>=&gt; (7 + 22 + 23 + 18 + 12 + 6 + 8) &times; 4 = 96 &times; 4 = 384</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><strong>VALIDATE</strong><strong> = ?</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>VALIDATE</strong><strong>&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;</strong>Total number of vowels (A, I, A, E) is 4.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Madhuri_SSC_14.05.2022_D29.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 206px;\" /></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Sum of the opposite alphabets place value &times; number of vowels = number.</strong></li>\n\t<li><strong>=&gt; (5 + 26 + 15 + 18 + 23 + 26 + 7 + 22) &times; 4 = 142 &times; 4 = 568</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Hence, &#39;<strong> VALIDATE</strong>&nbsp;&#39; is coded as&nbsp;<strong>&quot;568&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">तालिका में अक्षरों का स्थानीय मान दिया गया है:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/alphabet.png\" style=\"font-weight: 700; width: 450px; height: 107px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">यहां अनुसरण किया गया स्वरूप निम्नलिखित है:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong>विपरीत अक्षरों के </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">स्थानीय&nbsp;</span><strong>मान का योग &times; स्वरों की संख्या = संख्या</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">SHADOW को 184&nbsp;के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाता है</p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">SHADOW&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;</span>स्वरों<span style=\"\">&nbsp;(A, O)</span> की कुल संख्या 2 है।</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Madhuri_SSC_14.05.2022_D27.png\" style=\" width: 313px; height: 207px;\" /></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li>विपरीत अक्षरों के स्थानीय&nbsp;मान का योग &times; स्वरों की संख्या = संख्या</li>\n\t<li>=&gt; (8 + 19 + 26 + 23 + 12 + 4) &times; 2 = 92 &times; 2 = 184</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">तथा,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">TEDIOUS को 384 के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाता है</p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">TEDIOUS&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;</span>स्वरों<span style=\"\">&nbsp;(E, I, O, U)</span> की कुल संख्या&nbsp;4&nbsp;है।</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Madhuri_SSC_14.05.2022_D28.png\" style=\" width: 342px; height: 207px;\" /></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li>विपरीत अक्षरों के स्थानीय&nbsp;मान का योग &times; स्वरों की संख्या = संख्या</li>\n\t<li>=&gt; (7 + 22 + 23 + 18 + 12 + 6 + 8) &times; 4 = 96 &times; 4 = 384</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">इसी प्रकार,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">VALIDATE</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;= ?</span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">VALIDATE&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;</span>स्वरों<span style=\"\">&nbsp;(A, I, A, E)</span> की कुल संख्या&nbsp;4 है।</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Madhuri_SSC_14.05.2022_D29.png\" style=\" width: 402px; height: 206px;\" /></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li><strong>विपरीत अक्षरों के </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">स्थानीय&nbsp;</span><strong>मान का योग &times; स्वरों की संख्या = संख्या</strong></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">=&gt; (5 + 26 + 15 + 18 + 23 + 26 + 7 + 22) &times; 4 = 142 &times; 4 = 568</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">अतः, <strong>&#39;VALIDATE&#39;</strong> को <strong>&quot;568&quot;</strong> के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाएगा।</p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
  },
