    "correct": 4,
    "solution": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage102.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>Logic: <strong>(Sum of&nbsp;Reverse positional value of the letters)&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>&times; Number of vowels in that word</strong>.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Now,&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;VALUE&#39; is coded as &#39;222&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">V</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">L</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">U</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">26</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">6</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">22</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; Number of vowels in the word &#39;VALUE&#39; is 3.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;   \">&rarr;&nbsp;(5 + 26 + 15 + 6 + 22)&nbsp;&times; 3 </span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 74&nbsp;&times; 3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;   \">= 222.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;ORDER&#39; is coded as &#39;150&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">O</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">12</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">23</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">22</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; Number of vowels in the word &#39;ORDER&#39; is 2.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;   \">&rarr; (12 + 9 + 23 + 22 + 9)&nbsp;&times; 2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 75 &times; 2 = 150.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \">Similarly, <strong>for RIGHT:</strong></span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">G</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">H</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">18</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">20</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">19</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; Number of vowels in the word &#39;RIGHT&#39; is 1.</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \"><strong>&rarr; (9 + 18 + 20 + 19 + 7)&nbsp;&times; 1</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&rarr; 73 &times;&nbsp;1 = 73.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 4&quot;</strong></span>.</p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage102.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>यहाँ अनुसरण किया गया तर्क यह है:</p>\n\n<p>तर्क: <strong>(अक्षरों के विपरीत स्थितीय मान का योग) </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>&times; उस शब्द में स्वरों की संख्या</strong>।</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">अब,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;VALUE&#39; को &#39;222&#39; के रूप में कोडित किया गया है</span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">V</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">L</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">U</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">26</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">6</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">22</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; &#39;VALUE&#39; शब्द में स्वरों की संख्या 3 है।</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;   \">&rarr; (5 + 26 + 15 + 6 + 22) &times; 3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 74 &times; 3</span> <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;   \">= 222.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&#39;ORDER&#39; को &#39;150&#39; के रूप में कोडित किया गया है</span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">O</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">12</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">23</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">22</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; &#39;ORDER&#39; शब्द में स्वरों की संख्या 2 है।</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;   \">&rarr; (12 + 9 + 23 + 22 + 9) &times; 2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 75 &times; 2 = 150.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \">इसी प्रकार, <strong>&#39;RIGHT&#39; के लिए</strong></span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">G</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">H</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">18</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">20</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">19</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; &#39;Right&#39; शब्द में स्वरों की संख्या 1 है।</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \"><strong>&rarr; (9 + 18 + 20 + 19 + 7) &times; 1</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&rarr; 73 &times; 1 = 73.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \">अतः, सही उत्तर <strong>&quot;विकल्प 4&quot;</strong> है</span> ।</p>\n",
