  {
    "question": "In a certain code language, &#39;SOBER&#39; is coded as &#39;64&#39; and &#39;NOSTALGIA&#39; is coded as &#39;107&#39;. How will &#39;REPAIR&#39; be coded in that language?&nbsp;",
    "question_hi": "एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, &#39;SOBER&#39; को &#39;64&#39; और &#39;NOSTALGIA&#39; को &#39;107&#39; के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाता है। उसी भाषा में &#39;REPAIR&#39; को किस प्रकार <span style=\"\">कूटबद्ध&nbsp;</span>किया जाएगा?",
    "options": [
      "83",
      "67",
      "73",
      "80",
      "Question Not Attempted"
    ],
    "options_hi": [
      "83",
      "67",
      "73",
      "80",
      "अनुत्तरित प्रश्न"
    ],
    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage99.png\" style=\"height: 95px; width: 400px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic followed here is :-</p>\n\n<p>Sum of alphabet positional values of given word + Number of letters in given word.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&#39;SOBER&#39; is coded as &#39;64&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Savita_SSC_13-10-22_D51.png\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 111px;\" /></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Sum of alphabet positional value of the word = 19 + 15 + 2 + 5 + 18 = 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Number of letter = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 59 + 5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 64</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">And</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&#39;NOSTALGIA&#39; is coded as &#39;107&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Savita_SSC_13-10-22_D52.png\" style=\"width: 254px; height: 109px;\" /></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Sum of alphabet positional value of the word = 14 + 15 + 19 + 20 + 1 + 12 + 7 + 9 + 1 = 98</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Number of letter = 9</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 98 + 9</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 107</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Similarly,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&#39;REPAIR&#39; will be coded as :</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Savita_SSC_13-10-22_D53.png\" style=\"width: 167px; height: 108px;\" /></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Sum of alphabet positional value of the word = 18 + 5 + 16 + 1 + 9 + 18 = 67</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Number of letter = 6</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">= 67 + 6</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">= 73</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;73&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage99.png\" style=\"height: 95px; width: 400px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>यहाँ अनुसरित तर्क है :-</p>\n\n<p>दिए गए शब्द के वर्णमाला <span style=\"\">स्थितीय&nbsp;</span>मानों का योग + दिए गए शब्द में अक्षरों की संख्या।</p>\n\n<p>&#39;SOBER&#39; को &#39;64&#39; के रूप में <span style=\"\">कूटबद्ध&nbsp;</span>किया गया है।</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Savita_SSC_13-10-22_D51.png\" style=\" width: 170px; height: 111px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">शब्द के वर्णमाला&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">स्थितीय&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">​</span><span style=\"\">मानों का योग</span><span style=\"\"> = 19 + 15 + 2 + 5 + 18 = 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">अक्षरों की संख्या = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 59 + 5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 64</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">And</span></p>\n\n<p>&#39;NOSTALGIA&#39; को &#39;107&#39; के रूप में <span style=\"\">कूटबद्ध&nbsp;</span>किया गया है।</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Savita_SSC_13-10-22_D52.png\" style=\" width: 254px; height: 109px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">शब्द के वर्णमाला&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">स्थितीय&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">​</span><span style=\"\">मानों का योग = 14 + 15 + 19 + 20 + 1 + 12 + 7 + 9 + 1 = 98</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">अक्षरों की संख्या = 9</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 98 + 9</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 107</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">इसी प्रकार,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&#39;REPAIR&#39; </span>को इस प्रकार <span style=\"\">कूटबद्ध&nbsp;</span>किया जाएगा:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Savita_SSC_13-10-22_D53.png\" style=\" width: 167px; height: 108px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">शब्द के वर्णमाला&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">स्थितीय&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">​मानों का योग = 18 + 5 + 16 + 1 + 9 + 18 = 67</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">अक्षरों की संख्या = 6</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">= 67 + 6</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">= 73</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>अत:, सही उत्तर<strong> &quot;73&quot;</strong> है।</p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
  },
