    "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is :-</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/Alphabet%20Dia.png\" style=\" height: 117px; width: 550px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Sum of opposite alphabet positional values of given word + Number of letters in given word.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&lsquo;POEM&rsquo; is coded as &lsquo;63&rsquo;.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Savita_SSC_03-5-22_D41.png\" style=\"width: 157px; height: 199px;\" /></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Number of letter in word POEM = 4</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= (11 + 12 + 22 + 14) + 4</span></p>\n\n<p>= 59 + 4</p>\n\n<p>= 63.</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&lsquo;FILE&rsquo; will be coded as :</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Savita_SSC_03-5-22_D42.png\" style=\"width: 151px; height: 195px;\" /></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Number of letters of word FILE = 4</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= (21 + 18 + 15 + 22) + 4</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 76 + 4</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">= 80.</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;80&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>यहाँ अनुसरित तर्क इस प्रकार है :-</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/Alphabet%20Dia.png\" style=\"height: 117px; width: 550px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>दिए गए शब्द के विपरीत वर्णमाला के स्थानीय&nbsp;मानों का योग + दिए गए शब्द में अक्षरों की संख्या</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&#39;POEM&#39; को &#39;63&#39; के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाता है।</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Savita_SSC_03-5-22_D41.png\" style=\" width: 157px; height: 199px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>शब्द POEM में अक्षरों की संख्या<span style=\"\"> = 4</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= (11 + 12 + 22 + 14) + 4</span></p>\n\n<p>= 59 + 4</p>\n\n<p>= 63</p>\n\n<p>उसी प्रकार,</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&lsquo;FILE&rsquo; को इस प्रकार&nbsp;कूटबद्ध किया जाएगा&nbsp;:</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/05/F1_Savita_SSC_03-5-22_D42.png\" style=\" width: 151px; height: 195px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">शब्द FILE&nbsp;</span>में अक्षरों की संख्या&nbsp;<span style=\"\">= 4</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= (21 + 18 + 15 + 22) + 4</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 76 + 4</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">= 80</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>अतः, सही उत्तर <strong>&quot;80&quot; </strong>है।<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
  },
